# Secrets for the Supabase Edge Functions. Copy this to supabase/functions/.env
# for local `supabase functions serve`, OR (recommended) set them as GitHub
# repo secrets and let .github/workflows/deploy-functions.yml write them.
#
# !!! NEVER commit real values. This file (or .env) must stay gitignored.
# !!! EVERY key listed here is the real production value — do not use placeholders.

